  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Nordic</strong> 家具套装，适用于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a>，添加了完全可用的家具，包括但不限于：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屉</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等等！</p>\n<p>本家具套装的设计深受 <strong>《上古卷轴OL》</strong> 和 <strong>《上古卷轴V：天际》</strong> 的启发。</p>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>要合成 <strong>Nordic 木板</strong>/<strong>Nordic 羊毛</strong>，您必须输入 <strong>#minecraft:planks</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/stonecutter_planks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>要合成 <strong>Nordic</strong> 家具方块，您必须在 <strong>Furniture Station</strong> 中输入 <strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>Nordic 木板</strong> 和 <strong>Nordic 羊毛</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_nordic/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 <strong>Discord</strong> 社区</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
